      "role": "user",
      "content": "i had the weirdest thing happen today... i was sitting here and my heart started racing like crazy, almost like a panic attack but i wasnt even stressed. right as it happened, the sp500 just took this massive sudden dive out of nowhere. it was like i felt the drop before it even hit the screen. is that even possible? like could there be some kind of link between my own physiological state and the market volatility?",
